<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka M2 up 10.7 pct yr/yr in Jan '97.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka M2 up 10.7 pct yr/yr in Jan '97.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's M2 broad money supply rose 10.7 percent to 252 billion rupees in January over the same year ago period, the Central Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a report that M2 rose 18.2 percent to 228 billion rupees in January 1996.</p>
